   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "merge_patch.py: JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386)\nrevision.py: ETag, If-Match\nlunar.py: âm lịch Việt Nam (UTC+7)\nsecurity.py: Argon2id, JWT, refresh token\nstorage.py: presigned URL, head/delete (S3/R2)\nrevalidate.py: báo Next.js build lại trang",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "merge_patch.py: JSON Merge Patch (RFC 7386)\nrevision.py: ETag, If-Match\nlunar.py: âm lịch Việt Nam (UTC+7)\nsecurity.py: Argon2id, JWT, refresh token\nstorage.py: presigned URL, head/delete (S3/R2)\nrevalidate.py: báo Next.js build lại trang",
